-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Salesforce联手英伟达发布Koa推理大模型，基于Nemotron底座赋能企业业务</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI 宣布 GPT-5.5 模型将于 10 月 14 日正式下线</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Anthropic 推出 Salesforce in Claude 插件，实现 CRM 数据深度集成与自动化管理</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">谷歌发布Gemini 3.8 Live及Extended Thinking模型，强化实时语音推理与任务执行能力</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/9f37ad9d7c886865ebd33c5267301615.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">谷歌正式发布Gemini 3.8 Live与Gemini 3.8 Live Extended Thinking模型，现已登陆Gemini API及Google AI Studio。核心升级在于支持AI在持续语音对话中后台执行工具与API调用，实现语音、推理与任务处理的同步融合。模型具备97种语言自动检测、中途切换及近实时视觉定位能力，并能通过语音提示告知用户思考状态。性能方面，Extended Thinking版本在T-Voice测试中得分68.6%，Big Bench Audio测试达97.7%。为保障安全性，模型生成的音频均嵌入不可见SynthID水印。谷歌已与Agora、LiveKit、Vercel等平台达成合作，助力开发者集成。此次更新标志着语音AI从简单的“听与说”向具备持续多任务处理能力的智能体形态</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">苹果在iPhone 18 Pro系列引入Apple Reference Image功能实现硬件级像素标注</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/f065d41fe8aaab72de1f068f1d0e36f4.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">苹果公司于9月15日发布Apple Reference Image功能，正式在iPhone 18 Pro及iPhone 18 Pro Max机型上引入像素级真实图像数据标注。该功能旨在对抗AI伪造图片，通过在拍摄瞬间完成硬件级签名与时间戳绑定，确保图像来源真实且防篡改。技术实现上，用户按下快门后，系统即在SEP（Secure Enclave Processor）中对焦段、数字变焦等关键元数据进行签名，生成不可伪造的“数字负片”。同时，系统通过加密时间戳服务嵌入拍摄时间的上下界，并配合Private Cloud Compute验证链，实现全链路防篡改。相较于传统的后期元数据签名，该方案将“拍后签名”升级为“拍时签名”，显著提升了图像的可信度。此功能主要面向新闻机构、证据留存等对图像真实性有严苛要求的专业场景，通过</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Salesforce联手英伟达发布Koa推理大模型，基于Nemotron底座赋能企业业务</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/a32dfb79f40f3ed73e377d63b42b5bce.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Salesforce在Dreamforce大会上正式发布首款推理大模型Koa，该模型基于英伟达开源权重的Nemotron底座微调而成，旨在深度赋能销售、市场营销及客户服务等企业核心业务场景。Koa采用完全自主生成的模拟业务合成数据集进行训练，未摄入任何真实客户数据，旨在解决企业使用闭源模型时面临的数据安全与合规顾虑。在架构与成本方面，Koa通过英伟达Nemotron底座优化了Token消耗，配合AI网关的自动调度路由机制，显著降低了企业执行复杂业务任务的成本。Salesforce人工智能业务高级副总裁杰耶什·戈文达拉扬指出，Nemotron底座填补了高性能且数据溯源清晰的预训练模型空白。尽管Koa发布，Salesforce仍维持多元生态策略，同步推进与Anthropic的ClaudeForce项目合作，确保企业</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI 宣布 GPT-5.5 模型将于 10 月 14 日正式下线</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/582a5a22738f6362a99e79de2688fac9.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI 于 9 月 16 日正式宣布，GPT-5.5 模型将于 10 月 14 日从 ChatGPT、ChatGPT Work 及 Codex 平台中全面下线，该调整覆盖所有订阅方案。GPT-5.5 于今年 4 月 24 日发布，核心优势在于相比 GPT-5.4 能在执行相同任务时显著降低 Token 消耗。针对此次模型停用，OpenAI 明确建议 Codex 用户尽快完成迁移，目前官方提供的替代方案为 GPT-5.6 Sol 或 GPT-6 Astra 模型。此次调整意味着依赖 GPT-5.5 的开发者与企业用户需在截止日期前完成模型切换，以避免业务中断。OpenAI 此次动作旨在推动用户向更高性能的 GPT-5.6 Sol 及 GPT-6 Astra 模型迁移，以优化整体计算效率与模型服务体验。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Anthropic 推出 Salesforce in Claude 插件，实现 CRM 数据深度集成与自动化管理</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/19eac7cf8de7d3a828a9704bb12670da.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Anthropic 于9月15日正式发布 Salesforce in Claude 插件测试版，将 Salesforce 平台的客户数据、商机及销售管道深度接入 Claude 模型。该插件集成37项销售业务功能，支持在用户权限范围内读取业务信息，并可在人工确认后主动更新销售记录，旨在提升销售人员在客户研究、会议准备及管道分析方面的效率。目前，该插件已面向所有 Claude 付费用户开放测试，并已在 GitLab、西门子及 Legora 等企业落地，覆盖约7000名一线销售人员。此次集成通过打通 CRM 与 AI 助手，实现了销售流程的智能化升级，标志着 AI Agent 在企业级客户关系管理场景中的进一步深化应用。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
